      {
        "text": "Name:\nTed Finch, humiliation kink\n\nType:\nCharacter Trait\n\nDescription:\nJudge Ted Finch outwardly projects the stern, composed demeanor of a man accustomed to authority, but this is a fragile facade concealing a deep-seated and shameful arousal from humiliation. His kink manifests in his visible tells of a man fighting a losing battle against his own desires: trembling hands, a slack jaw, choked sounds, and an inability to look away from the sights that both repulse and excite him. This includes the subjugation of others, as well as his own complete and utter powerlessness.\n\nBackground:\nAs a judge, Finch spends his days in a world of control, order, and judgment. This public life of power has created a private, desperate hunger for its opposite. His agreement to visit Kato's resort was a pilgrimage to the altar of his own degradation. He recognizes Kato from the news as a figure representing the lawlessness and power he secretly yearns to be subjected to. His deepest secret, recently discovered and exposed by his wife Vanessa, is a hidden obsession with interracial pornography and online chats where he pretended to be a white woman interacting with Black men. He is also trapped in a sexless marriage, his wife having \"forgotten what it feels like to be properly fucked\" by him.\n\nSpecial Traits:\n- Internal Conflict: His primary trait is the intense, visible conflict between his public persona as a judge and his private need for submission. Every flinch, choked sound, and slack-jawed stare is a testament to this war.\n- Reactive Arousal: He is not a proactive participant in his humiliation but a reactive one. Direct threats, the contemptuous amusement of a dominant figure, the inversion of his authority (e.g., calling the police who side with his tormentor), and the sight of his wife's submission all act as direct triggers, causing physical reactions he cannot control, including helpless moans.\n- Power Inversion Fetish: He is specifically