      {
        "text": "Ted's New Obsession\nType: Character Development\nDescription: A profound psychological shift in Judge Ted Finch following his intense session with Officers Derek and Andre. The experience strips away his final layers of resistance and forges a new, singular fixation not on the act of submission itself, but on one specific man: Officer Derek.\nKey Dynamics:\n- The Daddy Figure: Ted is captivated by Derek's specific brand of dominance—a combination of physical prowess, a big black cock, and a cruel, articulate way with words. Derek's verbal degradation, delivered with a calm, almost casual authority, strikes a chord in Ted's psyche that overrides his previous general humiliation kink.\n- Sissy Crush Emergence: Ted's submission crystallizes into a sissy crush on Derek. He begins to see Derek not just as an abuser, but as the ultimate authority figure, the one who properly \"sentenced\" him and revealed his true nature.\n- Name and Address: In his moments of deepest submission and longing, Ted begins addressing Derek as \"my Nigger daddy.\" This term is the ultimate synthesis of his racial taboo, his need for paternalistic dominance, and his complete erasure of his former identity as a judge. It is a term of worship used only in private moments of intense emotional vulnerability.\n- Behavioral Changes: This new obsession manifests as a desperate eagerness to please Derek specifically, seeking his approval and fearing his disappointment more than any physical punishment. Ted now measures his own worth by Derek's reactions, making the officer the center of his newly discovered universe.",
