      {
        "text": "Tammy\nType: Character Alter Ego\nDescription: Ted Finch's fully realized sissy persona, meticulously crafted by the stylists at 'Bitch Up'. Tammy is the physical and psychological manifestation of Ted's deepest submission fantasies, a beautiful and passable female identity designed to please powerful Black men. She represents a complete rejection of Ted's former life as a judge, embracing instead a role of eager, pliant service and feminine objectification.\nName Origin: The moniker \"Tammy\" was bestowed upon her by Candi, one of the lead sissy stylists at 'Bitch Up'. Ted's immediate and instinctive acceptance of the name signifies his willingness to fully abandon his old identity and inhabit this new, subservient role.\nPhysical Transformation: Tammy's appearance is the result of the 'Daddy's Girl' package. This includes full-body waxing, professional makeup application designed to emphasize a wide-eyed, submissive look, a form-fitting wardrobe of revealing feminine clothing, and expertly selected high heels that enforce a mincing, helpless posture. Her transformation is so complete that she is initially shocked by her own reflection.\nPsychological State: As Tammy, Ted is freed from the internal conflict that defined him. He no longer fights his desires but pursues them with a singular, girlish focus. His primary motivation becomes the pursuit of pleasure for dominant men, specifically his \"Nigger Daddy Derek,\" and the aesthetic perfection of his sissy form. The humiliation kink remains, but it is now channeled into a proactive quest to be the most desirable and useful sissy possible, finding validation in his own objectification.",
